WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a low lunge, hook the front-leg shin high over the same-side upper arm.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Plant both hands shoulder-width apart, fingers spread.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Bend the elbows and lean the shoulders past the wrists.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Float the back leg straight behind you as the front foot lifts.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, gaze slightly forward, then lower with control and switch sides.
